[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11463.11, "timestamp": "03:11:03", "text": "因为是下午。呃，所以我把它放进去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11465.67, "timestamp": "03:11:05", "text": "在那里，我忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11469.83, "timestamp": "03:11:09", "text": "我真的忘了，然后我就想，哦，你个笨蛋"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11472.469, "timestamp": "03:11:12", "text": "你这个大笨蛋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11475.349, "timestamp": "03:11:15", "text": "你怎么可能忘记？你怎么能这样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11477.11, "timestamp": "03:11:17", "text": "忘记？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11485.59, "timestamp": "03:11:25", "text": "这就是名声。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11488.95, "timestamp": "03:11:28", "text": "还有，呃，我需要一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11498.79, "timestamp": "03:11:38", "text": "是6k。呃，让我暂停一下音乐。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11501.03, "timestamp": "03:11:41", "text": "除了我的声音，什么都别听见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11503.66, "timestamp": "03:11:43", "text": "正确的？让我结束这个话题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11504.87, "timestamp": "03:11:44", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11510.79, "timestamp": "03:11:50", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11512.79, "timestamp": "03:11:52", "text": "等待。让我赶紧把屏幕藏起来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11516.74, "timestamp": "03:11:56", "text": "我们这就展示一下。"}]